WEBVTT

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:37.070
That's...

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:39.330
That's huge!

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:41.330
My goddess?

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:42.940
Goddess?

00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:45.540
Does that mean he used a skill that summoned the goddess?

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:50.540
Fear me, humans.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:53.340
I am one of the Twelve Goddesses,

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:55.300
the Goddess of Night.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:02.560
(Episode 6 An Ordinary Guy Who Reincarnated
Into A Total Fantasy Knockout And The Free Spirit)

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:04.970
Don't tell me...

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:06.170
you were sleeping?

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:09.130
When it is time for eternity to awaken,

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:13.840
this world shall be engulfed by my darkness.

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:21.350
I'm sleepy.

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:23.260
It's still too early for me.

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:24.760
I think that's what she meant.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:27.150
(Oh...)
So she's the type that needs a translator, huh.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.690
My jet black servant,

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:32.290
why have you summoned me?

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:34.430
Well, about that...

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:36.700
I don't know if this is called a miracle or destiny.

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:40.100
If I have to be honest, perhaps this is a coincidence.

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:43.060
In other words, there's no actual reason.

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.910
Someone with the boldness

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:49.490
to invoke me for no reason is certainly
worthy to be my servant.

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:51.700
Now I see.

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:53.870
This goddess sure have the same vibe

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:55.070
as Schwa-kun.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.040
Looks like they have a better relationship

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:58.110
(That's nice)
than we do.

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:01.480
Schwartz von Liechtenstein Lohengramm.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:06.530
What's going on?

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.890
I apologize for our insolence all this time.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.210
I didn't expect you to be real.

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:13.760
That's what I've been telling you
from the very beginning!

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:18.040
How dare you presume my hero
cloaked in darkness as a fake.

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:28.690
She shrank!

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:34.060
No!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.410
I don't want to be charmed by a guy again!

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:38.770
Damn it! I got caught off guard!

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:39.890
I wonder why

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:41.220
I feel this way even though

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:42.340
I've done nothing wrong.

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:46.000
So you're the hero

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.490
chosen by the Goddess of Love?

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:49.030
Oh, yes.

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:51.250
At least, that's what I've heard.

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:53.990
You're a hero too?

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:57.940
The servant I have chosen overflows with
heroic spirit compared to you.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:59.100
I've won.

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:02.640
Well, I'm fine with losing,
so can you give me back my clothes?

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:05.620
But to actually summon two persons,

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:06.870
that Goddess of Love

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:07.910
is so sly.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.300
Speaking of which,

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:12.940
how did the two of you end up here together?

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:15.070
My hero,

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:17.330
when I first revealed myself to you,

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:18.540
didn't I ask you this:

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:22.190
In your opinion, what is the strongest thing?

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:23.980
Strongest thing?

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:26.400
That's jet black!

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:31.590
A blade of darkness dyed in jet black
that can cut through everything!

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:34.080
A perfect answer worthy of 100 points!

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:37.060
What was born out of that desire of a perfect score

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:38.790
is the holy sword, Gramm.

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:42.340
Wasn't it as great as the manifestation of myself?

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:43.680
I see.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:45.570
So that weapon was made under this sort of circumstance.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:47.880
No wonder it turned out that way.

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:50.660
How does my holy sword feel in your hands?

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:55.570
Well, i-it's under maintenance.

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:57.180
I see!

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:59.690
I'm really happy to know you're taking great care of it.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.570
(Conscience)

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:04.640
If you feel hurt for telling a lie,

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:06.450
there's still hope for you, Schwa-kun.

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:07.830
As I was saying,

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:12.300
we are to bestow upon the heroes we've summoned
with our blessing, and the abilities and weapon

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:13.460
that they desire.

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:16.490
That is the rule that we must obey.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:18.710
So that means...

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.010
If we meet our Goddess again,

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:23.660
I can ask her for an ultimate weapon?

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:25.330
What should I do?

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:26.900
The ultimate form, huh...

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.720
This is riling up my dormant teenage heart.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.170
No. You're wrong, Tachibana.

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:36.110
The reason she answered our question

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:38.050
for being summoned together with that is because

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:40.860
I am most probably supposed to be your weapon.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.830
You're quick on the uptake, human child.

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:46.160
No, wait.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:49.200
Wait, that's all wrong!

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:50.270
What's wrong about it?

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.360
It's strange, isn't it?

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:55.660
If that's the case, then what I believe to be

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.500
the "strongest thing" would be you!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:58.730
Tachibana...

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:01.420
So that's how you think of me.

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:04.100
Stop smirking!

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:05.460
No way that's possible!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:08.300
There's no way I'd have such an embarrassing thought!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:12.690
You probably just got dragged along with me
when I got summoned!

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.940
But the result has been committed.

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:18.060
How dare you counterattack me right here!

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.300
Come on, don't be shy.

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:22.650
- You're the one who is shy!
- These two get along really well.

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:24.110
Audrey-san.

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:25.090
No.

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:25.970
Brave hero!

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:26.360
Huh?

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:29.370
Will you marry me?

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:31.650
What?

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:33.410
My lord?

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:38.690
Right now, there are two heroes before me...

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:41.420
If this is indeed the reenactment of a legend,

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:43.640
then you are the pipe that connects me
to the nobility and royalty

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:45.920
and my bridge to the world of politics!

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:47.150
I see.

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:50.730
I was wondering why the lord didn't get charmed.

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:53.240
The villagers desired "faith."

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:56.030
Then, it was the elf and her "envy."

00:06:57.240 --> 00:07:00.100
For the interrogator, it was the desire to "protect".

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:03.810
As for the lord, he simply desired "ambition."

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:05.660
Depending on the person,

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:08.470
the desire that they feel towards
your beauty may be different.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:11.820
He lost his mind this time to your beauty

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.360
and status as the hero.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.620
Now I see...

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.700
But are you okay with that, Jinguji?

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:22.120
It would mean you reacted to my most popular attribute.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:26.180
Hey, hey, Jinguji!

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:27.230
Say, hey!

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:28.730
Hey?

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:31.310
Am I no good after all?

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:36.400
With your beauty backed by my brain,
we can dominate the economy!

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:40.440
It's fine even if there is no love between us,
let's save the world of politics and economy together!

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:43.380
Stop it, lord.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:46.410
Jinguji?

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:49.700
Her existence will most certainly bring doom!

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:52.530
Bring doom! Bring doom!

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:55.170
So you will stand in my way...

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:58.050
But the two of you aren't dating, am I correct?

00:07:58.420 --> 00:07:59.630
N-No, I...

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:02.020
I wasn't warning you from that perspective.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:04.130
My lord.

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:07.970
Please understand, my lord.

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:09.950
This is just...

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.880
a treatment.

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:19.310
I suppose this is the fastest way
to cure a polluted mind after all.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.670
Are we done?

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:22.090
Can I head back now?

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:24.270
Y-Yeah! Thanks for coming!

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:27.150
That said,

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.070
this land has become a holy land
where the goddess has descended upon!

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.390
We shall give praise to the night

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:36.020
and prosper as an inn town that prays
for the safety of travelers!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.820
I guess it was a good thing that we summoned the goddess.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:44.820
I was worried about how things would turn out at first.

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:46.730
Heroes!

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:50.350
I would like your cooperation in developing this town.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.130
Land, a house,

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.080
and even money will be provided.

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:54.960
How's that for a deal?

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:56.920
D-Does that mean

00:08:57.100 --> 00:09:00.210
I don't need to worry about food and shelter?!

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:01.620
Yes!

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:02.690
Please do!

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:05.250
In short, he'll be your patron.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:07.250
As for Audrey-san,

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:09.770
as long as you'd be here as a symbol,

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:12.610
I'll promise you three meals a day
including an afternoon nap.

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:16.480
Don't go promising others such an awfully
precise compensation!

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:20.640
But honestly, that is really tempting
for an exhausted working adult's heart.

00:09:21.230 --> 00:09:23.130
What do you think, Jinguji?

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:25.910
I am

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:27.910
against this.

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:29.520
Huh, why?

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:33.000
We'd get three meals a day and an afternoon nap
without lifting a finger!

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:35.050
Isn't that the dream of every working adult?!

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:37.120
That isn't something I dream of.

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:41.230
The lord did not say you don't have to work.

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:43.600
But he said I just need to be here.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:46.110
That's right, you only have to be here.

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:48.720
To have dinners and entertain big shots

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:49.980
on top of being a honey trap.

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:54.700
If it were me, I'd allow you to have afternoon naps
since I'll make you work at night.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:58.880
Right now, you aren't suited to remain in one place.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.880
Once people know about your existence,

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:01.930
those who want to make use of you

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:02.960
and those who want to get rid of you

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.960
will come for you non-stop.

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:07.090
But...

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:10.450
If you really want to turn me back as soon as possible,

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:13.680
then I think we should make use of everything we can!

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:17.920
When things get risky or dangerous,
then y-y-you can just protect me!

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.300
What if they try to poison you?

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.010
Schwa-kun can test my food for poison!

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.820
So he's just relying on everyone else!

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:26.500
I don't want to walk mountain paths anymore!

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:28.860
Oh, but that reason is quite honest.

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:32.570
That's because you relied too much
on modern convenience.

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:34.570
Hey, Tachibana.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:38.440
It isn't a bad idea to build pipes
that connect us to influential people.

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:40.560
In terms of both information and knowledge,

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:43.000
I'm sure we can get something definite by staying here.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:45.970
But, in that case,

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:48.660
can we say that we're enjoying a "journey of freedom"?

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:50.680
Isn't it okay to think of this

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:51.860
like a vacation?

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:55.870
We've been so busy with work that we haven't gone anywhere.
This is a parallel universe, right?

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.790
That means no one is here

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:58.920
and no one is looking!

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:00.930
I know I'm not being reasonable

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:04.510
and I'm aware that my opinion is strangely biased.

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:05.490
Perhaps...

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:09.290
That's how much I like idea that this is a vacation.

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:12.720
That's the reason I don't want to agree with this.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.950
Jinguji...

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:18.610
What do you think, Tachibana?

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:22.000
After you said it like that,

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:24.580
how can I say anything else?

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:29.040
(The next day)
See you! Thanks for everything!

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.380
We'll pray for your safe journey!

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.820
Be careful out there!

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:33.680
Farewell!

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:35.800
- We finally got a map of this world.
- Take care!

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:41.140
Did they say we're two weeks away from the royal capital?

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:42.680
I don't wanna walk.

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:46.240
If you do as the lord says,

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:48.310
we might have been able to make use
of their public facility.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.610
Hey, Jinguji.

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:54.580
About that "emotional bias"
you mentioned when we refused them,

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:57.540
that's what we call willfulness.

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:00.810
I'm not such a childish person.

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:05.440
No way. On the contrary, you're actually
more childish than anyone else!

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.470
That's not something I'll let you get away with!

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:12.530
Hey, wait up!

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:15.140
Explain what you meant by that clearly!

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:18.320
Alright! Let's go to the royal capital!

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:30.300
Did you see something just now?

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:33.210
Can we pretend we didn't see anything?

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:34.690
(Life With An Ordinary Guy
Who Reincarnated Into A Total Fantasy Knockout)

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.810
(Wanu  Usually tamed by humans
Carnivorous  Not a fast runner)

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:38.980
(Gets processed into meat
when it reaches the end of its lifespan  Delicious)

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.990
I dreamed of that time when I was a kid.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:45.220
My view was blurred by my tears,

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:47.450
so I think this wasn't a good dream.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:55.760
I remember how the light from between the trees
pierced my eyes when I looked up at the sky

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:57.210
and how the cicadas cried.

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:00.080
In the first place,

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:02.560
since when had I been friends with this guy?

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:06.660
Are you ready, Tachibana?

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:09.700
(Yukawa Municipal Elementary School  Graduation Album)

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:11.740
The graduation album from our elementary school?

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:14.100
That's a really nostalgic album.

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:18.390
This morning, I had a dream of a time
back in elementary school.

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:19.990
Look at this.

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:20.940
(Future Plans  No. 1
What is your future dream? Cellophane tape)

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.490
(No. 2 What will you be doing when you are 18 years old?)
(Studying overseas) What is my future dream?

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:23.620
Cellophane tape.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.630
Yeah, I remember this.

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:29.900
I recall that it really boggled my mind.

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:32.770
Between that and becoming a girl,

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.770
I'd rather you become a cellophane tape.

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:37.030
Being a cellophane tape is better?

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.730
Anyway, this part here is the main point.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.890
"What will you bring with you to an uninhabited island?"

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:45.890
(What will you bring with you to an uninhabited island?)
(Jinguji) You wrote my name here.

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:48.820
Yes! That means this is how my brain thinks:

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:51.550
I don't see you as the strongest weapon

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:53.010
but an item of convenience

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:55.280
and that's why I chose you! That's my theory!

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:00.680
If you're satisfied with that, then isn't it good enough?

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.940
I want to solve this misunderstanding between us!

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:06.900
I understand how you're feeling
but we cannot summon the goddess.

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:10.540
I think it's pointless to mull over this
when we don't even know the right answer.

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:14.440
Besides, that's a questionnaire from elementary school.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.880
Do you still want to be a cellophane tape?

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:19.220
A cellophane tape, you know!

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:22.020
What do you know about cellophane tape?!

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:24.810
At least I know that you don't know anything
about it at all.

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:27.070
You're making fun of me!

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:31.040
In that case,
I guess you must have a really incredible dream!

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.020
Stop it.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:33.420
Why should I?

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.740
Obviously because I'm embarrassed about it.

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:38.600
After you made fun of my dream,

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.790
don't you dare think you can get away with this!

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:42.530
Stop it, you idiot!

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.570
(Name: Tsukasa Jinguji  Birthday: 5 January 1989)
My graduation album!

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:49.120
That's for doing things others don't like!

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:52.180
Why do you hate it that much?!

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:55.220
Who was the one that laughed at me when I wrote this?!

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:56.090
I don't remember that!

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:01.830
I know I overreacted when I drew over it.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:04.460
But you were being quite childish too.

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:05.620
I don't care!

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:08.290
I'm not going to talk to you for the time being!

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:13.620
Go and reflect on it, you eggplant!

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:16.000
Your suit is an eggplant! An eggplant!

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:17.600
Eggplant...

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.030
Who in the world would draw over it?

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:24.670
What in the world was

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.320
Jinguji's dream again?

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:29.190
Damn it, I can't remember it!

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.380
My dumb brain!

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.100
Eggplant...

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.360
Why does this village

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.620
love squid so much?

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:40.810
Hey there, young couple!

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:42.030
Want some squid?

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:43.890
We're not a couple. So no, thanks.

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:46.230
Are you two quarreling?

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:48.770
Squibbing is no good at all!

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:50.110
No squib, just squid!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:53.910
Listen to me, youngsters.

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:55.620
The cure to an unhappy heart

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:57.810
is a tummy full of yummies!

00:15:57.810 --> 00:15:58.350
Squid...

00:15:58.350 --> 00:15:59.370
Chow down on our specialty!

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:00.970
And patch things up!

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:03.990
Here! Have one, young lady!

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:06.290
Looks tasty! Thanks!

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:10.700
Beer goes great with grilled squid.

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:13.140
Should I get the beer?

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:16.500
Well, just like the owner had said,

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:20.010
we were both being childish, so why don't we both
take a step back and make up?

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.370
I know I overdid it when I used a permanent marker.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.150
But as for you,

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:26.640
since we're living together now,

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:29.010
you should at least respect my privacy.

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:32.310
Hey, don't ignore me.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:34.220
Are you listening, Tachibana?

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:36.120
Hey, Tachibana?

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:37.320
Where are you?

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:39.380
This prank isn't funny.

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:42.200
The owner of the grilled squid store isn't here too...

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:44.640
This can't be... a kidnapping?!

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:47.290
No, calm down, Jinguji.

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:50.820
I shouldn't be panicking just because I can't see him.

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:52.830
It's Tachibana, after all...

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:56.510
It is possible that he's laughing
at my flustered reaction from afar.

00:16:57.470 --> 00:17:00.020
This might be revenge for the graduation album.

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:02.080
Meaning...

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:04.410
showing him my confused state is the right thing to do.

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:07.590
His smugness might go down if I pretend that I fell for it.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.030
It's ridiculous but

00:17:09.030 --> 00:17:12.590
I should also give Tachibana
the mental support he needs.

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:17.480
He doesn't realize that he is the one dancing
in the palm of my hands.

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:21.330
I guess it's my ego that wants you

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:22.590
to live your life like that.

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:24.460
This squid is delicious.

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:26.750
Well, I shouldn't be worried.

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:29.060
He's a perfectly functional adult.

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:30.950
As long as he doesn't trigger a pandemic,

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:33.310
I'm sure he is capable of taking care of himself.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.410
This carriage is...

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:39.340
the one the chieftain was on.

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:42.160
(Peerless Beauty) (Troublemaker)

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.500
(Q.E.D.)

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:47.330
Oh well, that was a boring job.

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:49.410
But the pay was good.

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:51.170
I should hurry up and head to the next--

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:53.170
Huh?

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.100
My cart...

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:01.360
How did it...

00:18:01.360 --> 00:18:03.850
Are you the owner of this carriage?

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:05.250
I'm sorry.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.440
I had only wanted to check it out

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:10.680
and I didn't intend to destroy it.

00:18:11.780 --> 00:18:14.190
but my hands wouldn't stop shaking.

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:16.840
First, why don't you calm down?

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:19.200
I am extremely calm right now.

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:21.620
In fact, I'm so calm

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:24.120
that you could say that I'm being way too calm.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:27.000
A calm person wouldn't be destroying other people's carts!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:27.760
Here, take this!

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:31.360
It's a type of herb with calming effect!

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:33.380
I'll give it to you for free!

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:34.480
Sniff it!

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:39.700
Are you a slave trader?

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.490
Didn't you have a female elf in this cart?

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:44.890
I don't specialize in that but...

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:48.570
You can think of me as trader with a wide variety of goods.

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.280
Are you looking for that elf?

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:55.190
No, I'm looking for a girl with blond hair and blue eyes.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:00.260
Have you seen such a person?

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:01.610
No, no.

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:03.310
Kidnapping isn't my thing!

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:05.910
Could she be beautiful?

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:06.540
Maybe?

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:09.290
Did she go missing in this village?

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.370
Yeah.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:13.090
In that case, you'd better hurry up.

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:17.580
Well, I was just thinking that it's been a while
since I had accepted such a horrible job.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.590
I didn't expect the beautiful elf
that I took the trouble to deliver

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:23.420
would be used as a sacrifice...

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:30.290
Damn you! What are you planning by taking me here?!

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:33.200
Don't you already have an inkling about that?

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.010
Is this it?

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:36.730
So it has finally come to this.

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:41.210
My beautiful self and a lust-filled human male!

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:45.050
(That sort of development)
In fact, it'd be odd if things don't end up that way!

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:47.920
Does my journey end here?

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:50.140
I'm sorry, my fellow villagers...

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:52.140
If I am to be sullied, then I'd rather...

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.290
Kill me!

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:55.570
I'd rather die than let you humans have your way with me!

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:56.440
Yeah, we will.

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:00.960
Because you're a sacrifice.

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:02.170
Sacrifice?

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:03.630
Didn't you know?

00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:06.610
We're going to offer you up at the end
of the festival tonight.

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:09.250
Then, am I going to die?

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:10.360
That's right.

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:11.780
I feel so sorry for you.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:13.480
Die...?

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:16.610
But this is really such a waste.

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:18.830
Body that is well-proportioned...

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:21.410
Eyes that shine with intelligence...

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:25.190
Smooth skin with rosy cheeks and lips...

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:28.630
Elegance that flows endlessly...

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:32.650
This is the first time I've seen
such a beautiful woman in my life.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:38.230
I can't believe that there's a human
who could appreciate my beauty.

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:42.730
Does picking me mean that you need someone beautiful?

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:48.190
Yeah. Our god commanded us to offer up
someone beautiful as sacrifice.

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:50.790
There were many other candidates

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:52.690
but you were unanimously chosen.

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:53.980
Oh...?

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:56.740
I see... Unanimous, you say?

00:20:56.740 --> 00:21:00.370
Well, I guess it's no surprise that I got chosen.

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:03.320
Being too beautiful is a sin indeed.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:04.930
And this is

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:07.600
the punishment that I must bear.

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:11.820
The way this man looks at me is strangely intense.

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:16.020
Upon closer look, this man is actually rather handsome...

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:19.710
I knew it, this man loves me.

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:22.970
In that case, I can use my charm to seduce him

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:25.200
and get myself out of this predicament!

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:27.960
But, what's a charm?

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:28.980
How do I do it?

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:30.980
Specifically, what am I supposed to do?

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:34.240
Like this? Or like this?

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:35.360
W-What's this?

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:37.170
She's doing all sorts of weird poses.

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:40.370
Well, just sit still until we sacrifice you--

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:42.000
Is that girl the sacrifice?

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:44.740
Are you sure about that, Mr. Left?

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:46.430
You are Mr. Right!

00:21:46.620 --> 00:21:48.180
What do you want now?

00:21:48.180 --> 00:21:49.600
We've already decided on the sacrifice--

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:52.130
You're right. We've certainly decided on that.

00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:56.180
- But what if we have a more beautiful girl than her?
- Ow!

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:01.440
What's going on? Where's this?

00:22:01.440 --> 00:22:01.870
Y...

00:22:01.870 --> 00:22:04.980
You fiend!

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:38.200
- The annual festival is here again.
- Here again.

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:41.070
- The squid dances for the fresh and young.
- Fresh and young.

00:23:41.070 --> 00:23:44.870
- Even the sacrifice is cute and young.
- Cute and young.

00:23:44.870 --> 00:23:46.960
(Episode 7)
- Squid, squid! - Young, young!

00:23:46.960 --> 00:23:48.660
- Squid, squid! - Young, young!

00:23:48.660 --> 00:23:49.640
(An Ordinary Guy Who Reincarnated
Into A Total Fantasy Knockout And The Squid Fire)
